            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Nana"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I added: grated small onion and left out the green onion, black pepper, more mayo, red wine vinegar. Used 2 packets of truvia instead of sugar. Doesn't need salt. Fine Grated carrots and coarser grated cabbage, and celery seed. Didn't use the bacon but one day I will. It's delish. Just adjust ingredients to your taste. I do that with all cooking except baked goods. That's my mamas department. :)",
            "datePublished": "2014-02-26T12:05:19.780Z"
          },
