              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "skp321"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I cut this recipe in half because it makes too much for a pound of cabbage. I also left off the bacon and cut down on the sugar. I sweetened it to taste so it was still a bit tart. Great recipe!!",
